<title>CANADA: Canada to auction C$2.8 bln bonds due Feb 2000.</title>
<headline>Canada to auction C$2.8 bln bonds due Feb 2000.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Government of Canada said it plans to auction on October 2 a total of C$2.8 billion of bonds with an unspecified coupon, maturing on February 1, 2000.</p>
<p>The Bank of Canada will acquire a minimum of C$280 million of the new bonds, which will be dated and delivered on October 15, it said.</p>
<p>The government said proceeds of the issue will be used for general purposes, and that there are no Government of Canada marketable bonds maturing on October 15.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100</p>
</text>
